[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m The expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m First, let's simplify the terms:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta))
