[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m To maximize this real part, we need to find the maximum value of \(324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta\). This is a linear combination of \(\cos \theta\) and \(\sin \theta\), and its maximum value is the amplitude of the expression, which is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
