[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m This can be expanded to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1047900)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta}{4} + i\frac{144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta}{4}.
